abstract: >-
  Python software for spatial wavelet features and run-wise classification of
  fMRI time series. Includes a package, CLI, synthetic example, and numerical
  and workflow tests. Source code only: no notebooks, laboratory data, or saved
  research outputs. Historical study results have not been reproduced.
keywords:
  - fMRI
  - neuroimaging
  - wavelets
  - spatial scales
  - classification
